{"author":{"id":"a3a282966ced55effb4560271fcd98e13241af24ea76b00ec76a0f18154bc8ee"},"ops":[{"type":3,"timestamp":1790024818,"nonce":"1vEhTzBrQquaJBTxPHJEVtuAZrc=","message":"From the config entity design (doc/design/config-entity.md, 3556569): a view or rule is one leaf (views/\u003cname\u003e, rules/\u003cname\u003e), so view patch \u003cname\u003e \u003cjson-patch\u003e applies the RFC 6902 patch to the document and emits one SetEntry with the result, through cache.ConfigCache.Update. --dry-run prints changes in the same shape schema import --dry-run does (E10, E11).","files":null}]}